# The jump, through the real keys (owner 2026-09-17): up a ledge a walk cannot
# climb, over a gap a walk cannot cross, down a drop a walk will not take — each
# found by what the ground IS near the player, never by a coordinate.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/jump.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# `ledge KIND` stands the player facing the nearest place a jump of that kind
# lands (Jump.find); `leap SECS` walks that way on the real move path and presses
# the real jump key, Space, on the move.
coast calm
zoom 9
wait 0.6
ledge up
wait 0.5
shot 01-a-ledge-a-walk-cannot-climb
leap 0.12
await jumping 2
wait 0.1
shot 02-in-the-air with jumping
await jumped:up 3
wait 0.5
shot 03-on-top-of-it
ledge down
wait 0.5
shot 04-a-drop-a-walk-will-not-take
leap 0.12
await jumped:down 3
wait 0.5
shot 05-down-it
ledge across
wait 0.5
shot 06-a-gap
leap 0.12
await jumping 2
wait 0.1
shot 07-over-it with jumping
await jumped:across 3
wait 0.5
shot 08-across-it
